{
  "type": "Collection",
  "id": "OPERA_L3_DISP-S1_V1_virtual",
  "stac_version": "1.1.0",
  "description": "ASF publishes gzipped Kerchunk JSON (.zarr.json.gz) per granule and per-frame displacement stacks. The links are in granule-level UMM RelatedUrls with Format 'Zarr', not at collection level, so they are modelled here as item_assets: generate one STAC Item per granule (or frame) from CMR, and give each Item's zarr-references asset a vrt:hrefs entry pointing at that Item's data asset. Both reference files and chunks need Earthdata Login. Powers the OPERA Displacement Portal.\n\nStatus (probed 2026-11-06): Production; granules to 2025-07.",
